# .cursorrules — Context Engineering Protocol

# 1. Deterministic Memory & Prefix Invariance
- Maintain stable prefix context to maximize KV cache hits.
- Do not inject ad-hoc timestamps or variable system summaries at the start of prompts.

# 2. Progressive Disclosure (Anti-Flooding)
- Before editing large files, read only exported symbol signatures or relevant function slices.
- Cap exploratory searches to maximum 15 matches (file:line:signature).

# 3. Patch Generation & Diff Verification
- Generate targeted search-and-replace patches or unified diffs.
- Avoid rewriting unchanged methods or boilerplate.
- Run typecheck and unit tests immediately after applying modifications.

# 4. Scope Boundaries
- Do not touch configuration or dependency manifests unless explicitly instructed.
